Scope note (narrowed 2026-08-21):

The MIT license above applies ONLY to the author-authored layers of this
repository: the verification scripts (`verify/`), the open-source baseline
runners and gate configurations (`sota/`, excluding third-party software,
which retains its own licenses — see `NOTICE.md`), the protocol and
benchmark documents (`protocol/`, `benchmarks/`), the experimental data in
`traces/`, and the documentation (including `README.md` and this file).

It does NOT apply to:

- `host/bin/` — the prebuilt host binaries are distributed for research
  reproduction only, under the separate terms in `host/README.md`;
- the manuscript (not included in this repository while under review);
- third-party software or data (see `NOTICE.md`).
